$3\(8 - 2 y\)- 4 y = 4 arrow.r.double.long 24 - 6 y - 4 y = 4 arrow.r.double.long - 10 y = - 20 arrow.r.double.long y = 2$.
Puis $x = 8 - 2\(2\)= 4$. Solution : $\(4 thick\;thick 2\)$.

