$2 X^2 + X - 1 = 0$. $Delta = 1^2 - 4\(2\)\(- 1\)= 9 = 3^2$.
$X_1 = frac(- 1 - 3, 4) = - 1$ et $X_2 = frac(- 1 + 3, 4) = 1 / 2$.

