$[x - 2 / 3 x^3 + x^5 / 5]_0^(0\,5) = 0\,5 - 2 / 3\(0\,125\)+ frac(0\,03125, 5) = 0\,5 - frac(0\,25, 3) + 0\,00625 = 0\,5 - 0\,08333 + 0\,00625 = 0\,42292 upright(" m")^3$.
$V = 0\,32 pi times 0\,42292 approx 0\,425 upright(" m")^3 = 425 upright(" litres")$.
